					>Google Scholar</a
				>
				·
				<a href="https://github.com/xianhanglin" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
				·
				<a href="mailto:xianhanglin7@gmail.com">Email</a>
			</p>
			<p>
